    <string name="telos_shizuku_howto_title">How to start</string>
    <string name="telos_shizuku_howto_body">Root: tap Start with root.\nWireless (no PC after the first pair): enable the Telos pairing accessibility service, open Developer options → Wireless debugging → Pair device with pairing code. Telos reads the 6-digit code from that Settings dialog only.\nComputer: USB debugging on, then run the adb command below (paths are for this install).</string>
